    <string name="ref_handoff_3_body">"English: Outfit · Arabic RTL: IBM Plex Sans Arabic · Numbers/Phones: JetBrains Mono (tabular-nums, dir=\"ltr\")\nSpacing: 4dp / 8dp / 12dp / 16dp / 20dp / 24dp / 32dp · Radius: 8dp–16dp"</string>
    <string name="ref_handoff_4_title">"4. Real Data Schema &amp; Android Telephony Notes"</string>
    <string name="ref_handoff_4_body">"Campaigns store id, name, simSlot (-1, 0, 1), and entries: ContactEntry[]. All progress metrics are derived dynamically from ContactEntry.status (pending | calling | answered | no_answer | failed | unverified) and ContactEntry.stage (none | potential | not_interested | call_back | whatsapp | voicemail).\nFull specification is saved in /HANDOFF_SPECIFICATION.md in the project root."</string>
